Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Time resume your flow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you been lurking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain that mark you have immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this sensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to make\Nthe arrow slip from my grasp?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This second...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I on my knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This man, he appeared atop the same\Nwall where Silver Chariot melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the arrow's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Something weird's going up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The game's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the day, the\Nfuture, and the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The life of the life, and\Nthe desire to stay gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I don't know? No, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,no...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:03:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It remains only the result\Nthat you will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The eternal life exists only in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sing songs of sadness\Nin the world without time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When I die, I will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, the beginning of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, sun's up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were out cold for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I can't remember exactly how. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are all soaked in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But... but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Something get us while we were down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt anywhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass behind some cover now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're injured, start patching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how can you even\Ntell if Giorno's hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see him? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see jack shit from way over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You look around, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You see him anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You just said he was hurt, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I grow a pair of chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, my tingling is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious, this is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are your hands bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You freaking moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the blood scared me shitless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But weirdly enough, I don't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be from all that freaky mold\NGiorno said he was gonna fix it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess he must have\Nmissed a couple of cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's possible the blood\Nstripping down from my
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,shoulder We talking about\Nthe same mold cuz I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I really sleep through\Nit all I feel really weird
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, this isn't my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I switched bodies with\NGiorno. No, wait. Our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds switched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this have happened\Nwhile we were sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To me and Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista and Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of messed up\Nvoodoo crap is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, people's minds\Ncouldn't just trade bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Am I? Did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What horrible curse is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I look hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My armpits stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Lord, just kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on now, Trish, that's just rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We got bigger things to worry\Nabout than the smell of my pits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,like the stand that attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look like the\Nhandiwork of Emperor Crimson,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:08:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,which can only mean we've got another\Nbad guy out there trying to mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it another one of his weird\Nlackeys that did this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss had already made it all\Nthe way to the Coliseum himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no sense in him passing\Nthe baton to an underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, Mista and Narancia\Nkeep talking about an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But is this really all there is to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our souls may have swapped bodies,\Nbut none of us are actually hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever ends up happening, just\Ndon't forget I'm technically older.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me with this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do everything to clean under your damn\Nnails and shave your knuckles too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called basic hygiene! Look it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Every part of me stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't I have switched\Nwith someone who showers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it have to be Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because we happen to\Npass out right next to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, you know words can hurt\Njust as much as bullets sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be that bad. Hey! Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think\Nyou're doing with those fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to cop\Na feel, I swear to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the elastic fit, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better kick those\Nhands out of my panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If I catch you touching anything\Nelse, I'll bury you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, jeez, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying these panties\Nfeel like a bunch of rubber
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,bands racing to see who can\Nsplit my ass in half first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And your bra's a real hugger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you even think about getting anywhere\Nnear my skirt again, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be nothing left of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Narancia, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay no attention,\Nbut I'm the dope, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I was wondering, if all of\Nus swap minds, did Bucciarati swap too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, it's me and Giorno\Nand Mista and Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If my first guess was correct and\Nwe swapped with the closest guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then where's Bucciarati now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching him this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The man hasn't so much as twitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about him. Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't approach him! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it happened to him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's in there might not be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So we should tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're saying, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends on what happened\Nbefore we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a way to even tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to know who was closest to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and what happened to the boss\Nand the man waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Scan the area with Lil' Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been trying\Nto do, but something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My my stand is refusing to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell won't you come out? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If our stands don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it some time. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Nice! He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see him fly past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he always do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going\Non, but it feels hella good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else be lit, or is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, man, I feel the same rush as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy to report my\Nbullets are still with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, they're hitting\Nharder than ever before!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just ripped through six\Nwhole metal railings with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a single shot and my focus\Nhas never been sharper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great and all but what kind\Nof stand swaps the souls of its victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this to us they're up to\Nsomething as much as I hate to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're all alone guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell where the boss is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just see lots of randos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like they're all out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many of them\Nand they're all spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My radar can't count them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I see someone moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a cop coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, what a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That police chick was smoking hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when I cupped her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tweet, tweet, tweet, tweet, tweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I think all these people\Nhad their souls swapped too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to stir up some chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, solving this is gonna\Nbe a bitch and a half, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using the ground as a medium to\Nsearch for lingering soul energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, nothing. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could Bucciarati have\Nswapped with? Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Giorno, rather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about the possibility\Nthat Bucciarati switched with the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can give you\Na little peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sense a trace of\Nthe boss's soul on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what really happened,\Nthen I would know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,this is gonna sound strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't sense his presence\Nanywhere for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess until Bucciarati\Nwakes up, we just won't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We should keep a close eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, Diavolo is your foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Arantia, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Giorno Giovanna, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:14:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not puppeteering this\Nturtle in any way. No tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you are speaking\Nto is the turtle itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one who asked you to\Ncome meet me here at the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But in my fight with Diavolo, I was\Nforced to abandon my body for this turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's a Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, spare me a moment to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I acted this way only because\NDiavolo afforded me no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the event that you are experiencing\Nas you stand there gawking
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,was brought about by the very\Narrow I had hoped to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I still hope to convey\Nthe secret of its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,even as I desperately fight\Nto hang on to my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.07,0:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying all of this\Nhappened because of the arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it in specific terms,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my Stan Silver Chariot that\Ntriggered this when he took hold of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My original body lies lifeless upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but by the grace of the\Narrow, my soul survived
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,when it latched on to this turtle's form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a body over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever did him in made a gigantic mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if everything you're\Nsaying is really true,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't that mean your\NSilver Chariot or whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's called can put us back\Nin our original bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In my current state,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot control Chariot, nor do\NI have any means to withdraw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I cannot discern his location either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As of now, he is like an agitated\Ncannon that's been set loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So your stance just wandering\Naround wreaking havoc?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just tell us what\Nhappened to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, how do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:15:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment I saw him standing right\Nbefore me, and then he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you must focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow is not your foe,\Nbut nor is it your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to explain to you\Nis the essence of hope itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin with an incident seemingly\Ntrivial to most from around two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Having somehow survived\Nmy encounter with Diavolo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I clawed my way to safety and\Nfound refuge in a small village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was there and then that\Nthe incident took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow I'd retrieved in Egypt had gotten\Nitself stuck behind a chest of drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a mild displeasure, but\Nannoying nonetheless an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,able-bodied person could\Nhave resolved the problem
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,without much difficulty\Nbut for someone like me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The task proved a little\Nchallenging. I briefly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,considered leaving it be\Nbefore the idea of using
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,chariot struck me that's\Nwhen it happened with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nary a warning the arrow\Nsliced chariots finger
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it happened so fast as\Nyou know the arrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,out stands in humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But should a stand happen to be\Nthe pierced party, the full extent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,of the arrow's history is unknown to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm beginning to\Nunderstand what was in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the mind of its creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've yet to witness the\Nfull power of a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Much more lies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden than one could imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, birds were falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Insects hid behind the leaves as\Ncattle collapsed to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, the farmers fell\Ninto a deep slumber as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And while I myself felt far from normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the effects on me were eclipsed\Nby what Chariot had endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken by a foreboding feeling, I seized\Nthe arrow from him before he lost himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, as if nothing had happened,\Neverything went back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long after, a most ominous\Nrealization dawned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever possessed enough\Npower to control the arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,could in turn steer the\Nminds of all living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, it cannot be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've grown much too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've been lying in wait for\Nbrave warriors like yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,willing to take the fight\Nstraight to Diavolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for me, that\NKana has me outclassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So all this mind control stuff\Nthat you're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is it the same thing that's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like we didn't actually\Nswitch souls after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said earlier, it's the arrow's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But as I cannot control it, the extent\Nof its power isn't something I can grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, its potential is undeniable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must retrieve the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Chariot before the boss\Ndoes, and take it back from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat Emperor Crimson,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have no other choice but to\Nharness this weapon's full potential!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna recapture the arrow,\Nwe'll have to destroy Silver Chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I correct to assume that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've taken the arrow from him,\Nhe'll inevitably finish his count of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not unlike how, in\Nessence, I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But before you all set off,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one last piece of\Nshocking information to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be the mademoiselle named Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little hairier than usual, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss is two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Some hours ago, one of them took on\Nyour appearance and deceived Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:19:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo and this lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They make a formidable\Nduo to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss confides in nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why no one knows his true face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really not sure I get it myself, but\NI know I saw him, that strange young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for him, Diavolo would\Nhave never gotten as close to me as he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he be two people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, something's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,From nine o'clock, Uno Signale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're heading for the\NColosseum's eastern entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be him! It's Diablo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Lil' Bomber. Jonah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely at the figure in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was there all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow has completely transformed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's now Chariot Requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabolo's gonna beat us to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he'll take the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.18,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay your hand for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that can't be a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Zipperman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means we found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fucerati.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They were accusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not always with a knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bad and what's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lead us a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
